			CTRLBossDefeated: defeated
			CTRLBossUndefeated: undefeated
			CTRLBossStatusSet: "{0} has been set to {1}."
			CTRLBossBulkPreHardmode: Toggle all pre-Hardmode bosses
			CTRLBossBulkHardmode: Toggle all Hardmode bosses
			CTRLBossBulkPostMoonLord: Toggle all post-Moon Lord bosses
			CTRLBossBulkAll: Toggle all bosses
